msgstr ""

#: src/Plugin.php:73
msgid "IRIOS Media for WooCommerce uses the WP Consent API, but it is not installed: without it there is no consent, so only contextual ads are shown and no events are sent. Install the \"WP Consent API\" plugin (and a compatible cookie banner) or change the consent mode."
msgstr ""

#: src/Plugin.php:78
msgid "IRIOS Media for WooCommerce: the WP Consent API is installed, but no cookie banner uses it. Without a banner there is no consent, so only contextual ads are shown and no events are sent. Activate a compatible banner (Complianz, CookieYes, Cookiebot…) or change the consent mode."
msgstr ""

